.SH "NAME"
Docv::CrystalPages::Literal \- Lays out constant values for display.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "docv/cli"\fR
.sp
\fBmodule Docv::CrystalPages::Literal\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
Lays out constant values for display.
.SH "CONSTANTS"
.TP 4
\fBLIMIT = 60\fR
Longest value shown in the constant\(aqs tag; longer ones get a display
of their own.
.PP
\fBPAIRS = {\(aq{\(aq => \(aq}\(aq, \(aq[\(aq => \(aq]\(aq}\fR
